{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Felsworn: idle Doomstride refreshes do not proc Twisted Onslaught or Uther's Light (#1427)",
  "contract": [
    "Twisted Onslaught (enchant 105115 equips 1968716): 'Your spell, ranged & melee attacks have chance to ...'.",
    "1968716 ProcFlags 0x10110: done melee-class, ranged-class and harmful magic spells; ProcChance 15.",
    "Uther's Light 8397 (Uther's Strength 11302): 'Has a 2% chance when struck in combat'.",
    "8397 ProcFlags 0x28: taken melee swings and taken melee-class spells; ProcChance 2.",
    "Neither may fire while the Felsworn stands idle: no attack is made and nothing strikes the character.",
    "Doomstride 804613 keeps the hidden resist helper 807962 on a Felsworn at full health.",
    "807962 lasts 11 s (SpellDuration 38); the Felsworn refresh recasts it on the character whenever it is missing.",
    "807962 has DmgClass 2 (melee): each recast is a done and a taken melee-class spell on the same character.",
    "Twisted Onslaught (SPELL_ATTR3_CAN_PROC_FROM_PROCS) and Uther's Light (taken flags) accept triggered spells.",
    "Removing the helper forces the same recast on demand instead of waiting 11 s per cycle.",
    "Over 40 idle recasts a 15% proc misses every time with probability 0.85^40 = 0.15%.",
    "Control: 40 Bane of Fire casts at an enemy still roll Twisted Onslaught (same 0.15% miss probability)."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 180000,
